flowchart TD
    Start([Start at cell]) --> Sense[Sense walls + openings]
    Sense --> Update[Update map: add walls, mark open/unknown]
    Update --> Flood[Compute floodfill distances on known map]
    Flood --> Reached{At goal?}
    Reached -- Yes --> End([END])
    Reached -- No --> HasMove{Any neighbor with finite distance?}
    HasMove -- Yes --> Choose[Pick lowest distance neighbor
    Tie-break: straight > right > left > back]
    HasMove -- No --> Fallback[Allow unknown neighbor or backtrack]
    Choose --> Move[Execute move; update pose]
    Fallback --> Move
    Move --> Sense